@startuml Sequence_B_Main
hide footbox
autonumber
actor User
participant "Bank Core" as Core
participant "Notification API" as API
database "PostgreSQL FSM" as DB
participant "Outbox Relay" as Relay
queue "Kafka" as Kafka
participant "Router" as Router
participant "Push Worker" as Push
participant "FCM / APNs" as FCM
participant "Mobile App" as App
participant "Callback API" as Callback

Core -> API: POST event + idempotency_key
API -> DB: BEGIN; INSERT notification + outbox
DB --> API: COMMIT
API --> Core: 202 Accepted + notification_id
Relay -> Kafka: Publish P0 event
Kafka -> Router: Consume
Router -> DB: BEGIN; CAS NEW -> PUSH_PENDING; insert push task + outbox; COMMIT
Relay -> DB: Poll committed outbox row
Relay -> Kafka: Publish push task
Kafka -> Push: Consume push task
Push -> FCM: Submit push
FCM --> Push: Accepted + provider_message_id
Push -> DB: Persist attempt result
Router -> DB: Set WAITING_FOR_APP_ACK; next_action_at = now + 8s
FCM -> App: Deliver (best effort)
App -> Callback: App ACK(notification_id)
Callback -> Kafka: Callback event
Kafka -> Router: Consume callback
Router -> DB: CAS WAITING_FOR_APP_ACK -> DELIVERED
@enduml
